Workflow: Docs to Project Converter

Purpose:
  Convert approved human-readable docs/ into AI-executable .sdd/project/ structure.

Input:
  Approved docs/ (all .md files)
  .sdd/skills/ (skill catalog for reference)

Output:
  .sdd/project/PROJECT.sdd
  .sdd/projects/{project_name}/architecture/system.sdd
  .sdd/projects/{project_name}/stack/backend.sdd
  .sdd/projects/{project_name}/stack/frontend.sdd
  .sdd/projects/{project_name}/stack/database.sdd
  .sdd/project/domains.sdd
  .sdd/project/modules.sdd
  .sdd/project/flows.sdd
  .sdd/project/dependencies.sdd
  .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/ (generated tasks)
  .sdd/projects/{project_name}/decisions/ (approved decisions)

Steps:
  1. PARSE_DOCS:
     - Read all approved docs/
     - Extract: tech_stack, architecture, domains, modules
     - Extract: decisions, constraints, goals, scale

  2. RESOLVE_TECH_STACK:
     - Map chosen technologies to .sdd/skills/ paths
     - Validate all skills exist
     - Assign competency levels (L1-L5)

  3. GENERATE_PROJECT_MODEL:
     - Create PROJECT.sdd with tech_stack, scale, goals
     - Create stack/*.sdd for each layer
     - Create domains.sdd with business domains
     - Create modules.sdd with technical modules
     - Create flows.sdd with execution chains

  4. GENERATE_TASKS:
     - Break down into executable tasks
     - Assign chains to tasks
     - Create .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/*.sdd

  5. VALIDATE:
     - Run .sdd linter
     - Validate all references resolve
     - Check policy compliance

  6. HUMAN_GATE:
     - Present .sdd/project/ for final approval
     - Human confirms before execution

Rules:
  [D2P1] All docs requirements MUST be in .sdd/project/.
  [D2P2] All references MUST resolve to existing skills.
  [D2P3] Tech stack MUST be consistent across all files.
  [D2P4] Tasks MUST be executable and testable.
  [D2P5] Human MUST approve .sdd/project/ before execution.

State: +
